20:18.770 --> 20:28.070
[Gerbang Yanxing]

20:39.510 --> 20:40.970
Benar-benar turun salju.

20:44.550 --> 20:46.080
Sudah kubilang sejak awal,

20:47.590 --> 20:49.440
